---
title: Shipment State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Ready : created when its warehouse RunPickingList reaches Ready
    Ready --> Issued : stock issued at dispatch confirmation (F96)
    Ready --> Exception : flagged as an exception (Operator, reason)
    Issued --> Delivering : handed to driver/vehicle for delivery
    Delivering --> Received : retailer confirms receipt of this portion
    Issued --> Exception : exception after issue
    Received --> [*]
    Exception --> [*]
